For a little while, I was a big part of this company.

1245
01:20:51,180 --> 01:20:53,440
那时我非常富有,大权在握
I was wicked rich and powerful.

1246
01:20:54,220 --> 01:20:56,950
有钱和权力并不是一件坏事
Now being rich and powerful isn't a bad thing.

1247
01:20:58,090 --> 01:21:01,990
而且那边的先生们似乎对此极为热衷
It looks like the Monopoly guy over there
is pretty darned psyched about it.

1248
01:21:02,990 --> 01:21:06,020
但问题是, 如果为了金钱和权力
But the problem is
what can happen when you decide...

1249
01:21:06,090 --> 01:21:10,460
不择手段会怎么样呢 ?
...that you would do absolutely anything
to become rich and powerful.

1250
01:21:10,530 --> 01:21:13,400
我不清楚你为什么心血来潮
I don't know who licked the red off
your lollipop today...

1251
01:21:13,470 --> 01:21:15,800
但你一定是选错了讲道的地方
...but you are preaching to the wrong choir.

1252
01:21:16,140 --> 01:21:18,300
我想说的是,
All I'm saying is, when you were kids...

1253
01:21:18,370 --> 01:21:21,570
你们小时候是否梦想过将来会成为
...did you dream
about becoming a savvy investor one day...

1254
01:21:21,840 --> 01:21:24,740
一个惟利是图的商人 ?
...who would think with his wallet
instead of his heart?

1255
01:21:25,910 --> 01:21:27,740
最起码, 我没有
Come on, I know I didn't.

1256
01:21:28,250 --> 01:21:29,980
我想当一个消防员
I wanted to be a fireman.

1257
01:21:30,790 --> 01:21:34,150
我想作一个帮别人解决困难的人
I wanted to be the guy everybody called on
if they were in trouble.

1258
01:21:34,590 --> 01:21:36,150
我希望能帮助别人
I wanted to help people...

1259
01:21:36,220 --> 01:21:39,350
当然, 从那些杆子上滑下来也挺有意思
...and yeah, I wanted to slide down
those wicked awesome poles.

1260
01:21:40,760 --> 01:21:44,160
而钱, 我总是最后才考虑
But money,
that was the last thing I thought about.

1261
01:21:45,130 --> 01:21:48,230
你呢, 先生 ?
你想过当个消防员吗 ?
What about you, sir?
Did you want to be a fireman?

1262
01:21:48,300 --> 01:21:49,630
没有
No, I did not.

1263
01:21:51,170 --> 01:21:53,440
说实话, 我曾经想当一个兽医
Truth be told, I wanted to be a veterinarian.

1264
01:21:53,510 --> 01:21:55,980
不错, 你为什么想当兽医 ?
Cool. Why would you want to do that?

1265
01:21:56,840 --> 01:21:59,780
- 我希望能帮助生病的动物
- 那你现在是干什么的?
-I wanted to help sick animals.
-And what do you do now?

1266
01:22:00,180 --> 01:22:02,170
我经营连锁屠宰场
I own a chain of slaughterhouses.

1267
01:22:02,620 --> 01:22:05,520
这好像和你的初衷背道而驰了吧?
You kind of went the other way
on that one, didn't you?

1268
01:22:06,590 --> 01:22:07,450
Okay.
Okay.

1269
01:22:07,520 --> 01:22:10,120
坐在后面的人, 请告诉我你的梦想
In the back. Come on.
Tell me what you wanted to be.

1270
01:22:10,190 --> 01:22:12,420
我想作一个魔术师 !
I wanted to be a magician.

1271
01:22:14,030 --> 01:22:18,090
- 那你现在做什么?
- 我经营一个色情网站
-And what do you do now?
-I operate a pornographic website.

1272
01:22:18,800 --> 01:22:22,860
我想, 那至少也能给某些人带来快乐,
不过不太光彩罢了
That makes people happy also, I guess.
But kind of in a grosser way.

1273
01:22:24,170 --> 01:22:26,500
- 还有谁 ?
- 我想作个议员
-Who else?
-I wanted to be a senator.

1274
01:22:27,010 --> 01:22:30,880
- 我想开花店
- 做闻名世界的煎饼
-I wanted to be a florist.
-International House Pancake.

1275
01:22:31,410 --> 01:22:33,070
我想作个男人
I wanted to be a man.

1276
01:22:35,220 --> 01:22:37,080
原来如此
That explains a lot.

1277
01:22:37,650 --> 01:22:39,880
我想作乒乓球冠军
I wanted to be a Ping-Pong champion.

1278
01:22:42,720 --> 01:22:45,590
但是, 你们没有实现自己的梦想, 对不对?
But you're not those things
you wanted to be, are you?

1279
01:22:46,060 --> 01:22:49,890
我们一次一次的向现实妥协...
Everybody made a compromise,
then another compromise, and now...

1280
01:22:49,960 --> 01:22:54,870
而现在, 你们正打算令5万人失去工作!
只是为了赚点快钱?
...you're about to put 50,000 people out of work,
to make a quick buck? Come on.

1281
01:22:55,370 --> 01:22:58,740
如果你们儿时的自己知道了今天的事儿
I bet if we ran into the 6th-grade versions
of ourselves right now...

1282
01:22:58,810 --> 01:23:01,800
我敢打赌, 他们一定会把你们折腾个半死
...they would kick our asses
and put Bubble Yum in our hair...

1283
01:23:01,880 --> 01:23:03,970
甚至不能容忍你们有这样的想法
...for even thinking about doing this.

1284
01:23:06,180 --> 01:23:08,770
没错, 我会把自己痛打一顿
He's right. I would've beat my greedy ass red.

1285
01:23:09,020 --> 01:23:11,380
我会让自己从旋转木马上飞出去!
I would've thrown myself off the merry-go-round.

1286
01:23:11,450 --> 01:23:15,910
我会把自己赤身裸体绑在椅子上,再用烟头烫 !
I would've tied myself naked to a chair
and burned myself with lit cigarettes.

1287
01:23:17,360 --> 01:23:20,290
这儿有人想过当心理医生吗 ?
Did anyone here dream
of becoming a psychiatrist?

1288
01:23:20,430 --> 01:23:21,620
开玩笑罢了, 朋友
Just kidding, pal.

1289
01:23:22,600 --> 01:23:25,400
现在还有机会挽救我们的童真 !
There's still hope for the kids inside of all of us.

1290
01:23:25,470 --> 01:23:27,930
请不要拆分我叔公的公司
Please don't break up my uncle's company.

1291
01:23:30,300 --> 01:23:31,970
我一直都想试试这个
I always wanted to do that.

1292
01:23:42,780 --> 01:23:43,770
不错...
Well...

1293
01:23:44,850 --> 01:23:46,680
...说的非常动情, Deeds.
...that was very touching, Deeds.

1294
01:23:47,820 --> 01:23:50,050
似乎拍卖的决议被否决了 ?
It appears this divestiture has been defeated.

1295
01:23:50,730 --> 01:23:52,590
不过我好像忘了一件事
Unless I'm forgetting something.

1296
01:23:54,060 --> 01:23:55,690
我自己的300万股份...
My 300 million votes...

1297
01:23:55,760 --> 01:23:59,670
再加上我为外国投资者代理的5万股
...plus the five million votes I control
as proxy for the foreign investors.

1298
01:23:59,730 --> 01:24:01,930
有了这百分之五十一的股份, 我该如何投票呢?
So which way should I vote my 51 percent?

1299
01:24:03,600 --> 01:24:04,830
我投赞成票 !
I vote aye.

1300
01:24:05,440 --> 01:24:07,630
305万票, 赞成!
305 million times.

1301
01:24:08,910 --> 01:24:12,780
赞成票获胜, Blake媒体公司不复存在了
The ayes have it. And Blake Media is no more.

1302
01:24:12,850 --> 01:24:14,640
别那么着急, Chuck.
Not so fast, Chuck.

1303
01:24:15,980 --> 01:24:19,280
你有麻烦了, 我小的时候,
一直想作个好记者
Too bad for you, when I was a kid,
I wanted to be a good reporter.

1304
01:24:19,350 --> 01:24:22,120
Bennett小姐, 我可不知道你也是股东
Miss Bennett,
I wasn't aware you were a stockholder.

1305
01:24:22,190 --> 01:24:24,350
你不知道的事儿还多着呢 !
There's a couple things you're not aware of.

1306
01:24:24,430 --> 01:24:26,950
比如说修眉毛
How to tweeze your eyebrows, for instance.

1307
01:24:27,460 --> 01:24:31,990
还有, 那就是: 当Deeds 放弃他的财产时,
那些财产其实并不属于他
Also, when Deeds gave away his fortune,
he gave away something that wasn't his.

1308
01:24:33,430 --> 01:24:37,890
- 你在说什么?
- 我手头有Preston Blake的日记
-What are you talking about?
-I have here the diary of Preston Blake.

1309
01:24:40,780 --> 01:24:42,210
是我偷来看的
I stole it and read it.

1310
01:24:42,280 --> 01:24:45,580
请别生气, 我是为了干好事 , 我保证
Please don't be mad at me.
I did it for good reasons, I promise.

1311
01:24:45,950 --> 01:24:48,920
我想在这里读一段Blake先生的日记
I would like to read a passage
from Mr. Blake's diary...

1312
01:24:49,180 --> 01:24:51,740
日期是: 1957年4月12日
...dated April 12, 1957.

1313
01:24:52,720 --> 01:24:55,020
" 我的欲望就要爆发
"I am a volcano of lust.

1314
01:24:55,160 --> 01:24:58,920
" 依靠心灵的指引, 我取得了事业的成功 "
"I've gotten this far in business
by following my heart.

1315
01:24:59,390 --> 01:25:01,120
" 如今, 它要再一次帮助我 "
"And I must follow it now...

1316
01:25:01,700 --> 01:25:02,990
" 寻找真爱 ! "
"...in love.

1317
01:25:04,730 --> 01:25:08,190
"只要她给我一个暗示, 一个机会"
"If she just gives me a sign, an opening."

1318
01:25:08,570 --> 01:25:11,440
要我帮您擦擦这些树叶么,Blake先生?
Want me to wipe the leaves
on your ficus tree, Mr. Blake?

1319
01:25:13,040 --> 01:25:14,770
你可以叫我Preston
You can call me Preston.

1320
01:25:16,810 --> 01:25:20,510
要我帮您擦树叶么, Preston?
Want me to wipe the leaves
on your ficus tree, Preston?

1321
01:25:22,220 --> 01:25:23,210
好的
Yes.

1322
01:25:25,350 --> 01:25:26,340
好的
Yes.

1323
01:25:27,260 --> 01:25:28,240
好的 ！
Yes!

1324
01:25:29,460 --> 01:25:31,360
那位神秘的女士是谁 ?
Who was this mystery woman?

1325
01:25:31,590 --> 01:25:36,220
这是Blake公司1957年4月的出入登记本
I have here the Blake Media ledger
sign-in book from April, 1957.

1326
01:25:36,900 --> 01:25:41,960
12号那晚, 只有一个女工在Blake所在的那层上班
On the night of the 12th, there was
only one woman working on Blake's floor.

1327
01:25:42,400 --> 01:25:46,860
不幸的是, 9个月之后, 她就去世了,
死于难产 !
Sadly, nine months later, she died,
giving birth to a son.

1328
01:25:47,440 --> 01:25:48,930
留下了一个男孩...
A son born...

1329
01:25:49,210 --> 01:25:52,150
...那天是1958年1月23日
...January 23, 1958.

1330
01:25:52,880 --> 01:25:54,250
那是我的生日!
That is my birthday.

1331
01:25:54,580 --> 01:25:56,740
Consuela Lopez小姐
To Miss Consuela Lopez.

1332
01:25:57,320 --> 01:25:58,750
那是我母亲!
That is my mother.

1333
01:25:58,920 --> 01:26:01,650
你才是400亿美元遗产的合法继承人!
And the rightful heir to $40 billion!

1334
01:26:02,090 --> 01:26:03,580
那是我的钱 ?
That is my money?

1335
01:26:03,790 --> 01:26:06,260
只需要一个简单的 DNA 测试就能证明
A simple DNA test will show...

1336
01:26:06,390 --> 01:26:10,460
Emilio Lopez 才是Blake媒体公司的最大股东
...that Emilio Lopez is the majority stockholder
to Blake Media.

1337
01:26:10,700 --> 01:26:12,830
- 那是我的钱!
- 是你的钱!
-It is my money!
-That's your money!

1338
01:26:13,000 --> 01:26:14,520
是我的钱 !
That is my money!

1339
01:26:16,140 --> 01:26:17,540
Way to go, Emilio!

1340
01:26:17,810 --> 01:26:20,210
我会为大家办好事的
I will do good things for everyone.

1341
01:26:20,710 --> 01:26:22,940
免费佛来明哥舞课程 !
Free flamenco lessons for all.

1342
01:26:23,040 --> 01:26:25,100
各位, 各位! 请静一静!
People, people! Please!

1343
01:26:25,280 --> 01:26:28,770
- 那是我的钱
- 别被误导, 那都是骗人的
-That is my money.
-Don't be misled. These are all lies.

1344
01:26:29,150 --> 01:26:30,450
Cedar...
Mr. Cedar...

1345
01:26:31,250 --> 01:26:32,410
... 你被解雇了
...you are fired.

1346
01:26:32,890 --> 01:26:34,620
你无权解雇我 !
You can't fire me!

1347
01:26:35,190 --> 01:26:36,660
我才是老板 !
I'm in control!

1348
01:26:37,020 --> 01:26:38,790
放开我 ! 我是 Chuck Cedar!
Get your hands off me! I'm Chuck Cedar!

1349
01:26:39,430 --> 01:26:41,190
那次, 在湖上你救了我...
At the lake, when you saved my life...

1350
01:26:41,260 --> 01:26:43,920
我还没机会谢谢你
...which I never got a chance
to properly thank you for--

1351
01:26:44,000 --> 01:26:46,520
- 别客气
- 你说你还不知道我是谁
-You're welcome.
-You said you didn't know who I was.

1352
01:26:46,600 --> 01:26:49,090
我突然意识到, 连我自己都不知道
And it made me realize I don't know who I am.

1353
01:26:49,270 --> 01:26:52,540
于是我决定要重新认识自己,
这是我目前的成果:
So I started working on it
and here's what I got so far.

1354
01:26:53,040 --> 01:26:56,500
我叫Babe Bennett.
我出生在长岛的Syossett
My name is Babe Bennett.
I grew up in Syossett, Long lsland.

1355
01:26:56,640 --> 01:27:00,600
我的眼睛是褐色, 不过我已经不记得
头发原来的颜色了
I have brown eyes and I don't know
what my natural hair color is anymore.

1356
01:27:00,980 --> 01:27:04,150
5年级时, 我极度崇拜Walter Cronkite.
When I was in 5th grade,
I got a crush on Walter Cronkite.

1357
01:27:04,220 --> 01:27:07,810
我跟你说的那个小本子是真的
And I really did have that Holly Hobby notebook
I was telling you about.

1358
01:27:07,920 --> 01:27:11,980
我喜欢Bruce Springsteen, Almond Roca的歌
还有Abbott 和 Costello 演的电影
I love Bruce Springsteen, Almond Roca
and Abbott and Costello movies.

1359
01:27:12,230 --> 01:27:14,290
我不喜欢甘草和自己的脚踝
I don't like licorice or my ankles.

1360
01:27:14,860 --> 01:27:18,030
最重要的是, 我明白自己干了蠢事
More importantly,
I know that I messed up real bad.

1361
01:27:18,200 --> 01:27:20,900
我愿意用一辈子的时间...
And I'd be willing to spend the rest of my life...

1362
01:27:21,270 --> 01:27:23,570
来请求你再给我一次机会
...begging you to give me another chance...

1363
01:27:23,740 --> 01:27:26,040
因为我深深的爱着你
...because I am so deeply in love with you...

1364
01:27:27,140 --> 01:27:30,580
我知道那是永远不变的爱
...and I know it's definitely
that forever kind of love--

1365
01:27:30,640 --> 01:27:31,980
你一定是疯了
You're crazy.

1366
01:27:34,420 --> 01:27:35,910
你的脚踝很漂亮
You have beautiful ankles.

1367
01:27:46,460 --> 01:27:47,930
咱们回家吧
Let's go home.

1368
01:27:50,400 --> 01:27:53,130
你被解雇了! 还有你 ! 你 ! 你 !
You're fired! You! You!

1369
01:27:53,430 --> 01:27:55,930
Oh, 你,先生, 我一定要炒了你
Oh, you, sir. You are definitely fired.

1370
01:27:56,570 --> 01:28:01,530
我希望能留下, 如果能再有一次机会,
我会做些好事的
I'd like to stay. I think I can really do
some good if I just got another chance.

1371
01:28:05,250 --> 01:28:09,270
可以不解雇, 但明早你要让我帮你换袜子
Not fired. But tomorrow morning,
you let me change your socks.

1372
01:28:10,920 --> 01:28:11,910
好的
Okay.

1373
01:28:13,220 --> 01:28:16,310
至于你, Long-Long-Longfellow...
And you, Long-Long-Longfellow...

1374
01:28:16,690 --> 01:28:19,990
是你让这一切成为现实的
...you are the one who made all this possible...

1375
01:28:20,060 --> 01:28:23,050
以你美妙的话语和善良的心灵
...with your beautiful words
and your beautiful spirit.

1376
01:28:23,400 --> 01:28:26,200
还有Bennett小姐, 了不起的调查工作
And Miss Bennett, with her beautiful research.

1377
01:28:26,730 --> 01:28:28,170
我该怎么感谢你呢 ?
How can I thank you?

1378
01:28:28,570 --> 01:28:31,730
有你的友谊就足够了, Emilio.
你是个好人
All I want is your friendship, Emilio.
You're a good man.

1379
01:28:32,970 --> 01:28:34,170
我会想你的
I'll miss you.

1380
01:28:35,610 --> 01:28:36,600
Deeds!
Deeds!

1381
01:28:37,910 --> 01:28:40,750
- 我给你10亿美元好吗 ?
- 好吧
-How about $1 billion?
-All right.

1382
01:28:41,280 --> 01:28:42,180
成交
Done.

1383
01:28:55,060 --> 01:28:56,120
天哪!
Holy Jeez!

1384
01:28:56,930 --> 01:28:58,400
难以置信!
I can't believe it!

1385
01:28:58,970 --> 01:29:01,370
- 什么事?
- Hallmark公司的回信
-What's that?
-A letter from Hallmark.

1386
01:29:01,440 --> 01:29:03,930
他们真的要买我的一张卡
They're actually going to buy one of my cards.

1387
01:29:04,040 --> 01:29:08,100
- 太好了! 是哪张?
- 我写给你的那张, 还记得吗?
-My gosh! Which one?
-The one I wrote for you, remember it?

1388
01:29:08,740 --> 01:29:10,140
我记得吗 ?
Do I remember?

1389
01:29:10,810 --> 01:29:13,680
"无法呼吸, 仿佛身在半空"
"Hard to breathe, feels like floating

1390
01:29:14,180 --> 01:29:16,780
"爱意荡漾, 怎将它心中锁"
"So full of love my heart's exploding

1391
01:29:17,050 --> 01:29:20,080
"如何启齿, 该怎把话儿说"
"Mouth is dry, hands are shaking

1392
01:29:20,490 --> 01:29:22,790
"毫无保留, 为你燃烧这爱之火"
"My heart is yours for the taking

1393
01:29:23,260 --> 01:29:25,560
"手足无措, 那不是真的我"
"Acting weird, not myself

1394
01:29:26,030 --> 01:29:28,620
"与你共舞, 仿佛梦幻中时光交错"
"Dancing around like the Keebler elf

1395
01:29:28,930 --> 01:29:31,990
"如愿以偿"
"Finally time for this poor schlub

1396
01:29:33,530 --> 01:29:36,660
"原来,爱的滋味令人着魔"
"to know how it feels to fall in lub"

1397
01:29:37,270 --> 01:29:38,570
我以你为荣!
I'm so proud of you!

1398
01:29:44,650 --> 01:29:47,410
简直不敢相信, Deeds给我们每人买了一辆
Can you believe Deeds bought us all these?

1399
01:29:51,990 --> 01:29:53,820
妈的, 这玩意儿真够快的!
Damn, these things are fast!

